    "cost": "Gemini Prompt/feedback estimates separately price uncached input, recorded cache reads, and output; total recorded cost over scored episodes is divided by accepted environments. Gemini and Grok Harness costs are the experiment-agent results supplied by the authors, not this script's raw-usage reconstruction. Grok Prompt/feedback and the other five models retain their original published costs. The conflicting Harness reconstruction is preserved as diagnostic evidence and is not used for Table 1. The other five rows retain their previously reported costs and have not been re-audited for cache accounting in this model refresh.",
